OL,3,GNEWSACrews adapt to tackle wildfire and
OL,4,Aflood 'extremes'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA senior fire officer believes her
OL,7,Ffirefighters are now in a cycle of
OL,8,Fdealing with wildfires and floods.
OL,10,FAnna Morris Jones, a group manager at
OL,11,FShropshire Fire and Rescue Service, was
OL,12,Finvolved in coordinating its wildfire
OL,13,Fresponse over the summer which she
OL,14,Fdescribed as "quite traumatic".
OL,16,FShe said it appeared as a result of
OL,17,Fclimate change, "we have two extremes,
OL,18,Fthe wildfires in the summer and then
OL,19,Fthe flooding in the winter".
